Z||000003||Old Lar||09-04-2001||09:18 PM||||In 1984 Fiero made 2001 Indy Pace car replica options. VIN # 1G2A F 37R...... F was the vin code for the pace car replica.  All had the 4 cylinder 2.5L engine with silver valve cover and air cleaner.<P>No actual Indy Pace cars (4 made) were sold to the public.  Those had carburated SD engines.<P>I am sure that the official Fiero Pace Car near Carpentersville, IL is one of the replica optioned 84 Fieros.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Oreif||09-04-2001||09:46 PM||||The one you saw is a official pace car replica sold in 1984. I have already seen it. The VIN # shows it is a pace car and one of the later built ones. (Late 84)<BR>They were closed when I saw it. Do you know what they are asking for it?||||reg||1
