Z||000006||007DOUG||09-05-2001||01:48 AM||||RPO code "Y82"<P>"Y82" is the option code for Indy trim.<P>The RPO sticker is found in the front compartment, attched to the driver's fender well.<P>------------------<BR>4 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top<BR>86 GT Red<BR>86 GT Yellow ASAP<BR>86 GT Blue w/4:10 tranny<BR>86 GT Pearl White 3.4 T-top<BR>88 Formula Red 5 speed<BR>2 Black 88 GT's (twins)<P>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||1
